QuestGuidance.Register("en",285,{
[9089]="7005FE51\n1\tComplete missions in Gundabad (total: 5)\tScout-master Ausma and Hórin can both be found at Vérnozal in Máttugard. You should complete Gundabad Missions with Scout-master Ausma and Hórin.\n2\tTalk to Zóva\tZóva can be found at Vérnozal in Máttugard. You should talk to Zóva.\n",
[9090]="7005A682\n1\tComplete missions in Gundabad (total: 20)\tScout-master Ausma and Hórin can both be found at Vérnozal in Máttugard. You should complete Gundabad Missions with Scout-master Ausma and Hórin.\n2\tTalk to Zóva\tZóva can be found at Vérnozal in Máttugard. You should talk to Zóva.\n",
[9091]="7005949D\n1\tComplete missions in the Wildwood (total: 10)\tRadhril can be found in Trestlebridge. You should complete missions in the Wildwood.\n2\tTalk to Radhril\tRadhril can be found in Trestlebridge. You should talk to Radhril.\n",
[9092]="70062E79\n1\tDefeat Idwal Redclaw in Gaervarad\030Defeat Emrys Redclaw in Gaervarad\tTwo brigand leaders of ill repute can be found within Gaervarad: Idwal and Emrys Redclaw.\n2\tTalk to Eilian Good-heart outside Gaervarad\tEilian Good-heart waits to hear of your successes outside Gaervarad.\n",
[9093]="70044AB3\n1\tTalk to Egwylf on the cliff-side road that runs into the Entwash Vale\tEgwylf mapped a course out of Wildermore, to the south-west of Forlaw. Bingo is ready to return to the warmer climate of Rohan, and asked Egwylf for the fastest route.\n2\tLook from the height for any sign of evil\tEgwylf asked you to look for signs of evil from the cliff-side path that runs from Wildermore to the Entwash Vale.\n3\tTalk to Bingo on the cliff-side road that runs into the Entwash Vale\tBingo is on the cliff-side path that leads between Wildermore and Entwash Vale. You thought you might have seen a tiny shape high in the sky and far away, but now it is gone.\n4\tThe town of Oserley is south-west of the road between Wildermore and the Entwash Vale. Bingo and Egwylf want to travel next to the town of Oserley, in West Rohan. When you arrive, you should speak to the townspeople for information.\t\n5\tTalk to Egwylf in the centre of Oserley\tEgwylf and Bingo are in the centre of the town of Oserley, in West Rohan.\n6\tTalk to Egwylf and leave Oserley by secret paths\tEgwylf and Bingo are in the centre of the town of Oserley, in West Rohan.\n7\tTalk to Egwylf in the town of Woodhurst\tEgwylf is in the town of Woodhurst, not far from the east gate. Tanglemane escaped with Bingo from the attack of the Nazgûl, but now the two of them are lost somewhere in Rohan.\n",
[9094]="70002CCF\n1\tSlay Morcheryn\tMorcheryn dwells in a cave on the east side of Ram Dúath, where the other merrevail can also be found. The Earth-kin scout has asked you to seek out and destroy the leader of the Merrevail for the safety of his people. He also suggested you take friends.\n2\tTalk to Earth-kin Scout\tThe Earth-kin Scout is hidden in a valley east of Duvairë in the Ram Dúath. With the Mistress of Shadows slain, you should return to him.\n",
[9095]="7006C6F3\n1\tMake your way to Igbâl's home in Jirush\tRaphûz asked you to meet him at Igbâl's home in Jirush. He is to meet the merchant for his role in Ardub's rescue.\n2\tSpeak with Galamê at Igbâl's home in Jirush\tWhen you arrived at Igbâl's home, it appeared that Raphûz was engaged in conversation with the man. Galamê, Igbâl's translator, summoned you to speak with him.\n3\tSpeak with Raphûz at Igbâl's home in Jirush\tGalamê asked if you knew Raphûz's intent and suggested he needed to speak with Igbâl. Galamê then suggested you speak with Raphûz.\n4\tSpeak with Galamê at Igbâl's home in Jirush\tAfter speaking with Raphûz, Galamê motioned and called for you to return and speak with him at Igbâl's home in Jirush.\n5\tSpeak with Ashâmi at Igbâl's home in Jirush\tAshâmi watched with great interest as you spoke with Galamê and Raphûz spoke with her father, Igbâl. She motioned you to come speak with her at her father Igbâl's home in Jirush.\n6\tSpeak with Raphûz at Igbâl's home in Jirush\tAshâmi asked you to dissuade Raphûz from whatever path her father, Igbâl, set him upon. She is concerned that the young man will be slain attempting whatever task her father set before him. She wants you to speak with Raphûz.\n7\tSpeak with Raphûz at his camp in Jirush\tRaphûz did not want to discuss what Igbâl asked of him at his home. He requested that you return to his camp in Jirush and speak to him there.\n",
[9096]="700460AB\n1\tGather trueleaf (total: 6)\030Gather blushblade (total: 4)\030Gather snagbane (total: 4)\tThe Houses of Healing can be found on the Sixth Circle of Minas Tirith. Look for trueleaf, blushblade, and snagbane within the High Hall, House of Remedies, or House of Rest.\n2\tMix edledhim at a mixing table\tMixing tables can be found in the High Hall, House of Remedies, or House of Rest, on the Sixth Circle of Minas Tirith. Find a mixing table and combine the ingredients into edledhim.\n3\tReturn to Ioreth\tIoreth stands in the High Hall of the Houses of Healing, on the Sixth Circle of Minas Tirith. You should return to Ioreth in the Houses of Healing and let her know you have prepared more edledhim.\n",
[9097]="700192FD\n1\tMock Târgrat the Proud\030Find Târgrat's encampment\tTârgrat is at Nardur-stazg in Fanuidhol, north-west of Talan Fanuidhol. In order to defeat Târgrat, despite the protection of his troll bodyguard, Maenhador has suggested that you try mocking him before his underlings.\n2\tDefeat Târgrat the Proud\tTârgrat is at Nardur-stazg in Fanuidhol, north-west of Talan Fanuidhol. In his rage over your insults, Târgrat the Proud has forsaken the protection of his bodyguard to pursue you personally. You must defeat him in battle.\n3\tTalk to Maenhador at Talan Fanuidhol\tMaenhador is at Talan Fanuidhol, south-east of Nardur-stazg. You should return to Maenhador with tidings of your victory against Târgrat.\n",
[9098]="700546CC\n1\tDestroy cages and supplies at Mokh Darga\tMokh Darga can be found in Parth Daenath. You should destroy cages and supplies at Mokh Darga.\n2\tDestroy cages at Mokh Darga (total: 12)\030Destroy supplies at Mokh Darga (total: 8)\tMokh Darga can be found in Parth Daenath. You should destroy cages and supplies at Mokh Darga.\n3\tCompleted\tDestroyed many cages and supplies at Mokh Darga.\n",
[9099]="700546CF\n1\tDefeat enemies at Mokh Darga\tMokh Darga can be found in Parth Daenath. You should defeat enemies at Mokh Darga.\n2\tDefeat goblins at Mokh Darga (total: 6)\030Defeat Orcs at Mokh Darga (total: 10)\030Defeat trolls or gertheryg at Mokh Darga (total: 2)\tMokh Darga can be found in Parth Daenath. You should defeat enemies at Mokh Darga.\n3\tCompleted\tDefeat many foes at Mokh Darga.\n",
[9100]="700542E4\n1\tDestroy supplies and Orc barricades at Mokh Shapat\tOrc barricades and supplies for battle can be found at Mokh Shapat in Arandor. You should destroy supplies and Orc barricades at Mokh Shapat.\n2\tDestroy Orc barricades (total: 8)\030Destroy Orc supplies (total: 10)\tOrc barricades and supplies for battle can be found at Mokh Shapat in Arandor. You should destroy supplies and Orc barricades at Mokh Shapat.\n3\tCompleted\tDestroyed many barricades and supplies at Mokh Shapat.\n",
[9101]="700542E1\n1\tDefeat enemies at Mokh Shapat\tMokh Shapat can be found in Arandor. You should defeat the champion of Mokh Shapat and the encampment's raiders.\n2\tDefeat the Champion of Mokh Shapat (quantity: see journal)\030Defeat Mokh Shapat's raiders (total: 5)\tMokh Shapat can be found in Arandor. You should defeat the champion of Mokh Shapat and the encampment's raiders.\n3\tCompleted\tDefeated many foes at Mokh Shapat.\n",
