[9114]="70028CF8\n1\tDefeat Wargs in Pren Gwydh (total: 12)\tWargs can be found throughout Pren Gwydh, especially around the easternmost edge of Pren Gwydh. You should defeat Wargs in Pren Gwydh to protect the folk of Galtrev.\n2\tFind Goronu and find out if the source of the Wargs has been discovered\tLuned sent forth a scout to find out where the Warg may have come from. You should meet up with Goronu to figure out why the Wargs have gathered in Pren Gwydh.\n",
[9115]="7003720F\n1\tDefeat the Guardian of the Shrine\030Defeat the Fastitocalon\030Defeat the Dragon of the Westfold\tIn the south-eastern part of the Fenmarch in the Eastfold dwells the Fastitocalon. In the north-western part of the Stonedeans dwells the Guardian of the Shrine. In the southern parts of the Westfold dwells a great and terrible dragon. Herehasen believes that mythical creatures actually dwell in Rohan and wants you to defeat them to prove him sane.\n2\tTalk to Herehasen at Tordag's camp\tHerehasen is at Tordag's camp south-east of Torsbury in the Broadacres. You should return to Herehasen and let him know that you found the legendary beasts exactly where he said they would be.\n",
[9116]="70026549\n1\tDisplay Ranger-flags from the monuments of Angmar (total: 6)\tMonuments of Angmar are spread throughout the ruins of Annúminas. Orchalwë asked you to find several Monuments of Angmar throughout the ruins and hang flags of the Rangers from them.\n2\tTalk to Orchalwë\tOrchalwë will want to speak with you about the monuments of Angmar.\n",
[9117]="70061BC4\n1\tCollect amethyst nightshade (total: 8)\tThe purple flowers of amethyst nightshade can be found to the north-east of Deryn, in Bloodhollow. Deryn has asked you to gather amethyst nightshade in Bloodhollow.\n2\tDeliver amethyst nightshade to Deryn\tDeryn can be found among his peers to the south-west of Bloodhollow. You have collected enough amethyst nightshade to satisfy Deryn's needs. You should return to Deryn.\n",
